{"strongs": "H5003", "word": "נאַף", "translit": "na.aph", "root": "נאף", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "commit adultery", "definition": "[ נאַף ] verb commit adultery (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic נְאַף (rare)): — Qal Imperfect 3 masculine singular יִנְאַף Lev 20:10 (twice in verse); 3 masculine plural וַיִּנְאָ֑פוּ Jer 5:7 + 3 t. Imperfect; Infinitive absolute נָאוֺף Jer 23:14 נָאֹף Hos 4:2 ; Jer 7:9 Participle נֹאֵף Prov 6:32 ; Job 24:15 feminine singular נֹאָ֑פֶת Lev 20:10 feminine plural נֹאֲפוֺת Ezek 16:38 + 2 t.; — 1. literally commit adultery: \\ \\ a. usually of man , always with wife of another; with accusative woman, Lev 20:10 (twice in verse) ( H ), Prov 6:32 elsewhere absolute Exod 20:14 = Deut 5:17 (Ten Words), Jer 5:7 ; Jer 7:9 ; Jer 23:14 ; Hos 4:2 participle masculine Lev 20:10 ( H ), Job 24:15 . \\ \\ b. of women , only participle Lev 20:10 ( H ), Ezek 16:38 ; Ezek 23:45 (twice in verse). 2. figurative of idolatrous worship , את האבן ואת העץ Jer 3:9 . Piel Perfect 3 feminine singular נִאֲפָה Jer 3:8 3 masculine plural נִאֵ֑פוּ Ezek 23:37 (twice in verse); Imperfect 3 masculine plural יְנַאֲפוּ Jer 29:23 3 feminine plural תְּנָאַפְנָה Hos 4:13 ; Hos 4:14 Participle מְנָאֵף Isa 57:3 plural מְנָאֲפִים Jer 9:1 + 4 t.; feminine מְנָאָ֑פֶת Prov 30:20 + 2 t.; — 1. literally commit adultery: \\ \\ a. of man , with accusative woman, Jer 29:23 absolute Ezek 23:37 pt plural Jer 9:2 ; Jer 23:10 ; Ps 50:18 . \\ \\ b. of woman , absolute Hos 4:13 ; Hos 4:14 participle Hos 3:1 ; Prov 30:20 plural Ezek 16:32 . 2. figurative of idolatrous worship , אֶתגִּֿלּוּלֵיהֶם Ezek 23:37 absolute Jer 3:8 , זֶאֶרַע מְנָאֵף Isa 57:3 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4917')\">BDB4917</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5003')\">H5003</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4916')\">BDB4916</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4918')\">BDB4918</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>נאַף</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>com